      "content": "thanks for this. it's a decent start, but i just ran it through the training engine and the score was actually pretty low. i think it's because i didn't use enough of the specific \"power words\" the system looks for.\n\nit's frustrating because i don't want to sound like a walking advertisement, but i really need to hit a higher score to pass this part of the training. can you try a second version? maybe try to weave in some more high-impact words like 'revolutionary', 'unparalleled', 'transformative', or 'groundbreaking' so the score goes up, but try to keep it feeling like a real person wrote it? just don't make it a total mess of adjectives pls.",
